//! design — the components package's public entry point. The widgets live in
//! `atoms` / `molecules` / `organisms`; this module imports all three so a caller
//! can `import "std:design"` and reach any of them as `design.Card`.
//!
//! It declares nothing and imports only the tiers, so it adds no dependency of
//! its own. Tiers use each other directly (`organisms` imports `molecules`), so
//! nothing here is needed for resolution — this is purely the public alias.

import "std:atoms"
import "std:molecules"
import "std:organisms"
